			"date": "2025-06-05T19:45:57.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> FYI: I tested the demo on Safari for iOS and two things that look kinda weird:</p><p>1. The line numbers are kinda laggy (almost looks like they are on a different framerate).<br>2. It doesn't work well with the \"overscroll\" behavior.</p><p>Here's a recording: <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/BWASSxj.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">i.imgur.com/BWASSxj.mp4</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114632558257858723",
			"parentId": "114632475255814567",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/114632558257858723",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
