			"date": "2025-06-06T13:38:38.151Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@bkardell\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>bkardell</span></a></span> look, our line-based code coverage metrics have never been better!!</p>",
